<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<title> Rongai Parking Bay - Slot Availability</title>
<style>
  body {
    font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
    background: #f4f4f4;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 20px;
  }
  h1 { color: #222; }
  .grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(5, 1fr);
    gap: 10px;
    max-width: 500px;
    margin: 20px auto;
  }
  .slot {
    padding: 20px 0;
    border-radius: 8px;
    color: white;
    font-weight: bold;
  }
  .free { background-color: #2ecc71; }
  .occupied { background-color: #e74c3c; }
  p { color: #555; }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<h1>Parking Slot Availability</h1>
<p>Live demo view — in the full system, this would update from the running program.</p>

<div class="grid">
  <div class="slot free">1</div>
  <div class="slot free">2</div>
  <div class="slot occupied">3</div>
  <div class="slot free">4</div>
  <div class="slot free">5</div>
  <div class="slot occupied">6</div>
  <div class="slot free">7</div>
  <div class="slot free">8</div>
  <div class="slot free">9</div>
  <div class="slot occupied">10</div>
  <div class="slot free">11</div>
  <div class="slot free">12</div>
  <div class="slot free">13</div>
  <div class="slot free">14</div>
  <div class="slot free">15</div>
  <div class="slot free">16</div>
  <div class="slot free">17</div>
  <div class="slot occupied">18</div>
  <div class="slot free">19</div>
  <div class="slot free">20</div>
</div>

<p>Green = Available &nbsp;&nbsp; Red = Occupied</p>

</body>
</html>